21270/22fbde01cf1832e346680a69ab1fcade96bfbb0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761939051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/22fbde01cf1832e346680a69ab1fcade96bfbb0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761939051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This is an action game where you can use weapons, bows and arrows, and martial arts, with slight partial nudity."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3525720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.poster.avif?t=1761939051\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.webm?t=1761939051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.mp4?t=1761939051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a game that I developed alone using Unreal. The story background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman trained in martial arts since childhood, she masters swordsmanship, archery, and formidable hand-to-hand combat! For some unknown reason, she finds herself trapped in a fantastical world. To return home, she must fight endlessly. This fantastical world features diverse regions, each with its own unique style\u2014wuxia, xianxia, dark fantasy, etc. She battles different enemies across these varied lands, embracing the thrill of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.poster.avif?t=1761939051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.webm?t=1761939051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.mp4?t=1761939051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018Swords &amp; Shadows\u2019 Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine faces relentless group battles\u2014swordsmen, shield bearers, archersk, a true swarm combat experience. No polite duels here\uff0cenemies rush in all at once, no holds barred!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch combat styles on the fly: Wield a tachi, switch to arrows, or go bare-handed\uff0cadapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tachi mastery against crowds:\u00a0Parry to deflect attackers, perfect dodge to counter \u2014 each slash carves a gleaming arc through foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unarmed? No problem! In this world, martial arts unleash &quot;Mountain-Splitting Strikes&quot; and &quot;Heart-Piercing Kicks&quot; \u2014 sending enemies flying in waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health packs\u2014style equals survival:\u00a0Regain HP by nailing parries, dodges, etc.\u00a0Build the Rage Gauge(Fire), when full, unleash a screen-clearing ultimate attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><